message: "If you use rateguard in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Deshmukh
    given-names: Vaibhav
title: "rateguard: A Thread-Safe Local Rate Limiter for LLM API Calls"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-05-08"
url: "https://github.com/vdeshmukh203/rateguard"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vdeshmukh203/rateguard"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - rate limiting
  - token bucket
  - sliding window
  - LLM
  - API
  - Python
abstract: >
  rateguard provides two thread-safe rate-limiting primitives — a token bucket
  and a sliding-window counter — for controlling the pace of calls to
  large-language-model API providers. Both primitives require only the Python
  standard library.
